---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import {CONTACT_EMAIL} from '../../lib/site';
---
<BaseLayout path="/contact/" title="Contact and Bug Reports" description="Contact Number Spinner by email to report bugs or suggest improvements for our free random wheel and number picker.">
<section class="hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Contact Number Spinner</span><h1>Help us make every pick better.</h1><p>Found a bug, a confusing result or a missing accessibility feature? We welcome constructive feedback.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container article">
  <h2>Email us directly</h2>
  <p>For questions, corrections and private feedback, email <a href={'mailto:' + CONTACT_EMAIL}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. Include the affected page and a brief description of the issue. Avoid sending sensitive student lists or personal details.</p>
  <p><a class="primary" href={'mailto:' + CONTACT_EMAIL + '?subject=Number%20Spinner%20Feedback'}>Email Number Spinner</a></p>
  <h2>Report a technical issue</h2>
  <p>You can also use the <a href="https://github.com/garrison2025/Random-Wheel/issues">public GitHub issue tracker</a> for reproducible bugs. Include the affected URL, browser, steps to reproduce and expected result. Never post private information publicly.</p>
  <h3>What is helpful to report?</h3>
  <p>Unexpected results, mismatched wheel animation, page errors, mobile layout issues and keyboard accessibility problems all help improve the tool.</p>
</div></section>
</BaseLayout>
